    spec.
  - [1mGreenfield, notifications-first by design[0m — you want the notification architecture settled before task CRUD, because
    the eventing shape should drive the data model.

  [1mMy recommendation:[0m if this repo is all there is, decompose. Notifications are entirely parasitic on a change-event
  stream — "tasks they care about change" needs a task, a change, and a notion of caring. Designing all three inside a
  notifications spec is how a spec quietly becomes three specs and none of them are good.

